			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Update encryption module naming convention in comments\n\nAlign the usage note in `Source/IPC/Encryption/mod.rs` with the project's strict PascalCase naming conventions. The comment previously suggested importing `MessageCompressor::MessageCompressor`, which conflicts with the module name. Update the guidance to explicitly reference the struct as `Compressor::Struct` within the `MessageCompressor` module.\n\nThis ensures developers correctly resolve the concrete type using the project's explicit qualification style, preventing symbol shadowing issues and maintaining consistency with recent refactorings across the IPC layer.",
			"SHA": "ef6c5b57eb906ef6d11c188226287068307780b7"
